{"items": [{"id": "3551993524", "type": "charms", "buy_price": 0, "img": "https://cdn.nookazon.com/diablo2resurrected/charm/charm_small.png", "description": "Good charms have at least **1 high primary** roll.\n*Items with low lvl reqs can be valuable! Check the bottom of this info for details.*\n\n[color=#7ED321]Primary Value[/color] **[color=#7ED321]Prefixes[/color]**\n|Prefix|Range| ilvl (max) |\n|:-|:-|:-|\n|Fine|**[color=#00baf8]1-3 max[/color]** dmg & **[color=#00baf8]10-20[/color]** AR| 42 | \n|Single Resist|**[color=#00baf8]3-11[/color]** resist one element| 54 | \n|All Resist|**[color=#00baf8]3-5[/color]** all resist| 47 | \n|AR|**[color=#00baf8]2-36[/color]** AR| 71 | \n|Cld Dmg*|**[color=#00baf8]1-10[/color]** min & **[color=#00baf8]2-20[/color]** max Cold dmg| 95 | \n|Fir Dmg*|**[color=#00baf8]3-19[/color]** min & **[color=#00baf8]2-29[/color]** max Fire dmg| 94 | \n|Lgt Dmg*|1 min & **[color=#00baf8]6-71[/color]** max Lightning dmg| 94 \n|Psn Dmg*|**[color=#00baf8]15-175[/color]** psn dmg, **[color=#00baf8]3-6[/color]** s.| 95 |\n\n**Only valuable if high roll & paired with suffix of the same elemental dmg*\n\n[color=#7ED321]Primary Value [/color]**[color=#7ED321]Suffixes[/color]** \n|Suffix|Range|ilvl (max)|\n|:-----|:---:|:---:|\n|HP|**[color=#00baf8]5-20[/color]** life| 61 |\n|MF|**[color=#00baf8]3-7[/color]** mf| 61 |\n|Cld Dmg*|**[color=#00baf8]2-5 min[/color]** & **[color=#00baf8]2-9[/color]** max cold dmg| 60 |\n|Fir Dmg*|**[color=#00baf8]1-7[/color]** min & **[color=#00baf8]2-13[/color]** max fire dmg| 59 |\n|Lgt Dmg*|1 min & **[color=#00baf8]3-28[/color]** max lightning dmg| 59 |\n|Psn Dmg*|**[color=#00baf8]6-50[/color]** psn dmg, **[color=#00baf8]3-6[/color]** s.| 58 |\n\n**Only valuable if high roll & paired with prefix of the same elemental dmg*\n\n---------\n*Secondary value affixes **only** add value when paired with a high-rolled primary value affix (above)*\n\n[color=#F5A623]Secondary Value[/color] **[color=#F5A623]Prefixes[/color]** \n|Prefix|Range|ilvl (max)|\n|:-----|:---:|:---:|\n|Min|1 min dmg| 95 |\n|Max|1 max dmg| 90 | \n|Mana|**[color=#00baf8]1-17[/color]** mana| 62 | \n\n[color=#F5A623]Secondary Value[/color] **[color=#F5A623]suffixes[/color]** \n|Suffix|Range|ilvl (max)|\n|:-----|:---:|:---:|\n|Str|**[color=#00baf8]1-2[/color]** str| 36 |\n|Dex|**[color=#00baf8]1-2[/color]** dex| 36 | \n|Max|1 max dmg| 92 | \n|FRW|3 FRW| 49 | \n|FHR|5 FHR| 51 | \n|Gold|**[color=#00baf8]5-10[/color]** gold find| 1 | \n\n-----------\n\n*Some PVP players (those focusing on Low Level Duelling, LLD) value low lvl reqs. \nSometimes lower rolls are more valuable than higher! Common LLD max-levels include:* \n\n***9, 12, 18, 30, 49**.*\n\n*Charms with max lvl reqs below these levels that still have 2 mods and good primary value rolls are desired by these players and expensive trade items!*", "active": true, "mode": null, "unlocked_at": null, "created_at": "2021-10-05T15:42:17.167Z", "slug": "small-charm", "name": "Small Charm", "variants": [{"id": 697648126, "name": "Bear Claw", "img": "https://cdn.nookazon.com/diablo2resurrected/charm/charm_small2.png", "format": null, "active": true, "visible": true}, {"id": 431842039, "name": "Coin", "img": "https://cdn.nookazon.com/diablo2resurrected/charm/charm_small3.png", "format": null, "active": true, "visible": true}, {"id": 2119238500, "name": "Football", "img": "https://cdn.nookazon.com/diablo2resurrected/charm/charm_small.png", "format": null, "active": true, "visible": true}], "tags": [{"tag_id": 228, "tag": "Charm", "category": "Item Type", "format": null}], "properties": [{"property_id": 399, "property": "+{{value}} Defense", "options": null, "img": null, "type": "number", "id": 399, "required": false, "affected_properties": null, "min": 0, "max": null, "default_value": 1, "format": {"index": 71}, "item_format": null}, {"property_id": 400, "property": "+{{value}} to Mana", "options": null, "img": null, "type": "number", "id": 400, "required": false, "affected_prope